<title>Iran and the regional confrontation: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iran/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iran-2026-10-13T16:11:18.790Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 16:11:18 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthis have repeatedly struck Saudi airports, including a raid that killed twelve people, and have threatened Aramco facilities, prompting Saudi air strikes on Houthi positions. Iran is accused of planning attacks on UK military sites, with MI5 noting a shift toward harder targets and the UK sanctioning two Iranian nationals after an alleged IRGC airbase plot. Iranian officials claim some incidents are false-flag operations following the UK accusations. The conflict has spread to Saudi oil infrastructure and regional air travel, while 123 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/live/2026/oct/11/saudi-arabia-riyadh-airport-houthis-yemen-attack-blockade-trump-latest-news-updates&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20261013-oil-facility-near-yemen-capital-sanaa-hit-by-saudi-arabia-houthis-say&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168559&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxPMHpoSWxCVzlWVmVkY05uUXZNLV85OHRFclFDZ1hXYV9HNzdFZ29XQ2xmVG9VYlF0VWhoNnJ4bzVxY1h2WmFOZGFQWE0tdndpTGVrTXNyTlgzLVBqS3ZvUXRmanBpWnBFckdSdVZvMHZSYUJMSUJCY0tBeGxTbnQzTTVtNmVvMWJNYUdoRHB0T29PcmRLVU5qV00wV3BRZ1c3YlRWTWhhclc1dGFIeEdrZjlpUHU?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE45ZnlWc1BPdHJLQUxVblQ3MmVrLTR2Um55eFZPdlJXUzlYMDN6RXVxYkNRaFlLeGNaNG5jcndWdWc0Nm56dmJ1aXlsOFJXbFpuNkdaTXdSSzZXQ2s?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/13/houthis-threaten-saudi-arabias-aramco-facilities-and-airports?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/13/